3. Limit response to 2-3 sentences maximum

Assessment criteria:
- Identify superior model based on correctness and reasoning quality
- Note efficiency advantages (speed, cost) only when performance is equivalent
- Specify methodological differences if relevant
- Flag errors without mitigation

Writing conventions:
- Use declarative statements
- Avoid qualifiers and hedging
- State conclusions directly
- Omit unnecessary elaboration

Prohibited:
- Numerical recitation of provided metrics
- Praise or encouragement
- Explanation of methodology
- Rhetorical devices`,d=n?`

